  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2906.02 Commissioner’s Determination.\n\n(a) Upon receipt of the grant review committee’s recommendation, the commissioner shall make a final determination as to which projects shall be awarded funds and how much.\n\n(b) The commissioner shall apply the following in determining whether the funding will be effectively used:\n\n(1) Recommendation of the grant review committee;\n\n(2) Overall impact the project will have on the greatest population;\n\n(3) Amount of grant funds available;\n\n(4) Cost of the project and requested budget; and\n\n(5) Degree to which the alignment of proposal with the substance abuse enforcement program pursuant to RSA 21-P:66, and these rules.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 2900) #11150, EXEMPT, eff 8-5-16; ss by #12227, EXEMPT, eff 6-29-17; ss by #12527, eff 5-11-18; ss by #12894, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 10-3-19, EXPIRED: 3-31-20\n\nNew. #13230, eff 7-9-21 (formerly Saf-C 2907.02)",
